1
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:06,350
Writing Assignment

2
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:19,400
Teacher gives class an essay topic: "What did you do to help mother?"

3
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:29,110
I hesitate, then write: "I have helped mother many times.

4
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:40,600
I sweep house and wash dishes. Sometimes, I wash face towel."

5
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:51,350
At home mother often does everything, so I find it very hard to write.

6
00:00:51,350 --> 00:01:04,660
I think hard, then continue writing: "I wash undershirt, shirt and pants."

7
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:21,570
Last sentence I write: "I want to help mother with more work, so mother less tired."

8
00:01:21,570 --> 00:01:30,880
A few days later, Sunday morning, mother tells me:

9
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:42,400
- Nguyen this, today you wash shirt and underwear right!

10
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:56,000
I widen eyes. But then I gladly agree, because that is work I already said in writing assignment.

